@ClaimsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5086

### Create a claim
POST {{ClaimsApi_HostAddress}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Motor",
  "market": "UAE",
  "description": "Rear-ended at a traffic light, bumper and boot damaged.",
  "estimatedAmount": 4250.50,
  "incidentDate": "2026-11-15",
  "claimant": "Jane Doe"
}

### List all claims
GET {{ClaimsApi_HostAddress}}/api/claims

### List claims filtered by status and claimant
GET {{ClaimsApi_HostAddress}}/api/claims?status=Submitted&claimant=Jane Doe

### Get one claim (paste an id from the create response)
GET {{ClaimsApi_HostAddress}}/api/claims/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Invalid: future date, missing description, 3 decimals
POST {{ClaimsApi_HostAddress}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "Property",
  "market": "UAE",
  "estimatedAmount": 10.555,
  "incidentDate": "2099-01-01",
  "claimant": "Jane Doe"
}
